// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Crimson 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3990080396" "Crimson"
// ProfessionString :
"P3529646963" "Wetwork agent"
// DescriptionString :
"P3331681205" "If Indigo is the velvet glove then the agent code named Crimson is the steel fist. His heightened senses help him follow the trails that his partner scouts and then his skill with weapons covers the rest. He is totally commited to ending the threat presented by the Malta group."
// HelloString :
"P4117557379" "All right, now, listen up."
// HelloString :
"P2573092837" "You've got the detail."
// HelloString :
"P276625251" "Get the job done, hero."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3740379973" "Talk to {LastContactName}. Move out."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3659119494" "Indigo has been keeping tabs on you. She says you are good, here's your chance to convince me."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3204497661" "I have nothing more for you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1479551817" "Clean your plate, {HeroName}, then talk to me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4221002249" "You need to be Security Level {Level} before I pass on any more intel."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2688479635" "Not bad, friend. These <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A>should help you. I want you to call in your position frequently."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P991960306" "You've impressed me. Here are some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A>."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4023900865" "Time for you to move on, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
"P891522995" "Peregrine Island"
// IntroString :
"P1488674848" "Crimson is the second half of the most efficient spy tandem the government has available. He is just as determined as his partner to take out the Malta group. He can provide Focus and Genetic Alteration Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1061125607" "Choose Crimson"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3525031452" "Indigo and her partner Crimson are very different personalities but they make a deadly team."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P897441820" "One of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> wishes to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3242756621" "Some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> of mine wish an introduction."
