// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Maria Jenkins 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2028158969" "Maria Jenkins"
// ProfessionString :
"P3288645287" "Former Heroine"
// DescriptionString :
"P3325733594" "In the early days of the Statesman's costumed career, he worked with a woman called Madame Danger. Maria Jenkins, as she called in her other identity, was his closest friend and confidant for many years. Slowly her powers began to fade with time but she was aging quite slowly. When she met Statesman in the 1930's she appeared to be in her mid twenties. Although she is retired, Maria certainly does not look over a hundred years of age. Maria was the first to deduce Statesman's kidnapping by Tyrant years ago, and was happy to have her friend returned to her."
// HelloString :
"P3630917869" "This is a difficult time for us all."
// HelloString :
"P2953089184" "We must find a way to persevere."
// HelloString :
"P861402012" "I am glad to see that you don't have any quit in you, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2534964235" "I think you should still be speaking with {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2175277512" "Well hello there. You must be {HeroName}. I have been hearing a lot about you. If anyone can help me, I am sure it will be you."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3719170383" "That's all I have for you. Thank you so much for your help."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2146527981" "I think you have some other things to take care of first."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P229877539" "What I need done shouldn't be tried by anyone below Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3415707571" "Here are some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> for you, my young friend. Stay in touch."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2524192719" "You are a firecracker, {HeroName}! Here are more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A>."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3399882546" "Time for you to help others, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2230845648" "Maria Jenkins was a close friend of Statesman. She has a history in dealing with the Praetorians and is one of the foremost experts on them on Primal Earth. She also has Relic, Focus, Gadget, Invention, and Genetic Alteration Enhancements. I'll warn you: Maria is investigating some very dangerous people. If you work with her, you'll want to bring along some friends to help you out."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3830638085" "Choose Maria Jenkins"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3024268243" "Very few people have the kind of insight into Praetoria that Maria does."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1652623372" "One of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends</A> wants to get to know you better."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3957261535" "Some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> I know want to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


