// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Harvey Maylor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1883418727" "Harvey Maylor"
// ProfessionString :
"P2377486615" "Tabloid editor"
// DescriptionString :
"P2821683028" "As the editor of The Paragon Tattler, Harvey Maylor is a man always looking for a story. After all, when the Paragon Times is reporting on the giant demon roaming the old Astoria cemetery, what's left for a tabloid to print? Harvey fulfills his journalistic responsibilities by leaning heavily of the broad shoulders of his hero friends. Hero-authored columns sell papers, and photos of super-powered shenanigans make a great front page. He's willing to accommodate his hero sources, either putting them in the spotlight or carefully protecting their identities. As a result, he usually has a claim on the strangest scoop in town."
// HelloString :
"P1900715505" "Heya!"
// HelloString :
"P4263022553" "What news?"
// HelloString :
"P3690045206" "You are not going to believe this."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1608644719" "I really think you ought to be talking to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P282234103" "Hey there hero! Let's see if we can dig up some dirt on these clowns from the Carnival of Shadows and bury them with it."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1741222338" "I don't have anything more for you, check out your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P82712937" "I think you have some stuff to take care of already, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3784704388" "What I've got lined up needs someone of at least Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1109505189" "For you, my friend, I have the best <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A>. You got news, you call me, hear?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P711667522" "Here are some more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> for my good friend, {HeroName}."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3219427476" "Harvey Maylor is a loudmouth and a sensationalist, but he is on the hot on the trail of the Carnival of Shadows. He loves to work with heroes, especially ones skilled with magic, and can provide Relic and Focus Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P4092459465" "Choose Harvey Maylor"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1261686733" "I hope you don't mind being on the cover of the Paragon Tattler, {HeroName}."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4101035596" "One of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> would like to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3672956856" "Some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> of mine have been angling for an introduction."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


