// Contact Name : Unai Kemen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4236326606" "Unai Kemen"
// ProfessionString :
"P791763215" "Portal Corp Security Chief"
// DescriptionString :
"P3817455982" "Unai Kemen was given his name by a set of young Basque twin girls that he was hired to bodyguard. In their language it means 'Strong Sheperd'. Tragically, the girls were killed by a super powered villain and Unai retired. It was years before he was contacted by Portal Corporation to coordinate their security. He refused at first, but relented when the Freedom Phalanx sent Statesman to encourage him. Unai still has no idea why he was asked to assume so much responsibility, but he is determined not to fail again."
// HelloString :
"P50310699" "Greetings, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P4021267173" "The storm is rising around us."
// HelloString :
"P1326249416" "Allow me to help you."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2814261360" "I believe you should be speaking with {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1851535941" "The situation here on Peregrine Island is growing quite grave."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P986730333" "I don't have anything more for you, perhaps your other contacts have something?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P570402265" "You need to finish some of the things you already have on your plate, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1317581692" "I have something, but it's classified beyond your current Security Level."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2409652352" "I am grateful for your assistance, friend. I offer these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> to you. Please call upon me if you are in need."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3132670738" "You are destined for greatness, {HeroName}. I want you to have the best <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A>available."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3489931718" "The storm continues but for now you need to focus your enegy elsewhere, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3884270376" "Unai Kemen is the Security Chief for the Portal Corporation. He is on the front line of the dimensional war. He can offer Gadget and Relic Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1643984372" "Choose Unai Kemen"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3581994835" "The dimensional rips on Peregrine Island are increasing, {HeroName}."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4119286404" "I have a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>buddy</A> I'd like you to meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3706455638" "You should meet some of my other <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts.</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

